<span data-as="p">Claude Code sends the hook’s <a href="#hook-input-and-output" class="link">JSON input</a> as the POST request body with <code>Content-Type: application/json</code>. The response body uses the same <a href="#json-output" class="link">JSON output format</a> as command hooks.</span>
<span data-as="p">Error handling differs from command hooks; see <a href="#http-response-handling" class="link">HTTP response handling</a>.</span>
