<span data-as="p">In addition to the <a href="#common-input-fields" class="link">common input fields</a>, UserPromptExpansion hooks receive <code>expansion_type</code>, <code>command_name</code>, <code>command_args</code>, <code>command_source</code>, and the original <code>prompt</code> string. The <code>expansion_type</code> field is <code>slash_command</code> for skill and custom commands, or <code>mcp_prompt</code> for MCP server prompts.</span>
