<a id="powershell"></a>
<h5>PowerShell</h5>
<span data-as="p">Executes PowerShell commands. See the <a class="link" href="/docs/en/tools-reference#powershell-tool">PowerShell tool</a> for availability by platform.</span>
<span data-as="p">The fields match the Bash tool, with the command string in <code>command</code>:</span>
