<span data-as="p">Runs when a task is being created via the <code>TaskCreate</code> tool. Use this to enforce naming conventions, require task descriptions, or prevent certain tasks from being created. In a <a class="link" href="/docs/en/tools-reference#task-tool-availability">session without the Task tools</a>, this event doesn’t fire.</span>
<span data-as="p">TaskCreated hooks don’t support matchers and fire on every occurrence.</span>
