<span data-as="p">A TaskCreated hook can block the creation in two ways. Either way, Claude Code deletes the task and returns your message to Claude as the tool’s error. Claude Code ignores <code>continue: false</code> from this event and Claude keeps working.</span>
<ul>
<li><strong>Exit code 2</strong>: Claude Code returns the stderr text as the message.</li>
<li><strong>JSON <code>{&quot;decision&quot;: &quot;block&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;...&quot;}</code></strong>: Claude Code returns <code>reason</code> as the message.</li>
</ul>
