<span data-as="p">TeammateIdle hooks support two ways to control teammate behavior:</span>
<ul>
<li><strong>Exit code 2</strong>: the teammate receives the stderr message as feedback and continues working instead of going idle.</li>
<li><strong>JSON <code>{&quot;continue&quot;: false, &quot;stopReason&quot;: &quot;...&quot;}</code></strong>: stops the teammate entirely, matching <code>Stop</code> hook behavior. The <code>stopReason</code> is shown to the user.</li>
