<span data-as="p">Runs when an MCP server requests user input mid-task. By default, Claude Code shows an interactive dialog for the user to respond. Hooks can intercept this request and respond programmatically, skipping the dialog entirely.</span>
<span data-as="p">The matcher field matches against the MCP server name.</span>
