<span data-as="p">Hook execution details are written to the debug log file. Start Claude Code with <code>claude --debug-file &lt;path&gt;</code> to write the log to a known location, or run <code>claude --debug</code> and read the log at <code>~/.claude/debug/&lt;session-id&gt;.txt</code>. The <code>--debug</code> flag doesn’t print to the terminal.</span>
